      "english": ".. “This course is not about getting students to ‘eat less’, but about teaching them how to live healthily.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "在体育场，老师教学生们怎么做运动；",
      "traditional": "在體育場，老師教學生們怎麼做運動；",
