    "sentence_translations": [
      "Peking University’s “Weight Loss Miracle Course”",
      "",
      "Peking University has a very special course. The students all call it the “weight loss miracle course”.",
      "Teacher Zhang, who teaches this course, said, ..",
      ".. “This course is not about getting students to ‘eat less’, but about teaching them how to live healthily.”",
      "In the classroom, the teacher teaches students how to eat healthily.",
      "On the sports field, the teacher teaches students how to exercise.",
      "In the cafeteria, the teacher also helps students choose healthy food.",
      "",
      "After taking this course, some students not only lost weight but also felt that they slept better.",
      "",
      "This course is very popular. Not only do the students at the school like it, but people online are also very interested.",
      "Many people online say, “I really want to attend this course” and “If I could take this course, losing weight would be much easier.”"
    ]
